Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Tennessee</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Tennessee Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Tennessee Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Tennessee Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Tennessee House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Tennessee statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>URLTA (applies in counties that adopted it): five-day grace period for rent. (TN Courts, Landlord Tenant Update presentation (URLTA slide); <a href='https://www.tncourts.gov/sites/default/files/docs/landlordtenant_-_presentation_0.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Outside URLTA counties, only four sections of 66-7-101 et seq. apply: 109 (termination of tenancy), 110 (tenants with disabilities), 111 (service and support animals), 112 (domestic abuse). (TN Courts, Landlord Tenant Update presentation; <a href='https://www.tncourts.gov/sites/default/files/docs/landlordtenant_-_presentation_0.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Tenant domestic-abuse protections appear in 66-28-205 and 66-28-517 (URLTA) and 66-7-109 and 66-7-112 (non-URLTA). (TN Courts, Landlord Tenant Update presentation; <a href='https://www.tncourts.gov/sites/default/files/docs/landlordtenant_-_presentation_0.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Tennessee?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Tennessee houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/tennessee-squatters-rights-adverse-possession/'>Tennessee Squatters Rights and Adverse Possession</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/tennessee-eviction-notice/'>Tennessee Eviction Notice: Types and Days</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/tennessee-probate-laws/'>Tennessee Probate Laws: Inheritance and Sales</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/tennessee-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Tennessee guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-tennessee/'>We buy houses in Tennessee</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.tncourts.gov/sites/default/files/docs/landlordtenant_-_presentation_0.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>TN Courts, Landlord Tenant Update presentation (URLTA slide)</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Tennessee Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Tennessee\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-tennessee/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Tennessee Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/tennessee-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Tennessee Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights", "rank_math_description": "Tennessee landlord tenant law and tenant rights: deposits, notices, entry and selling a rented house. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "tennessee tenant rights"}, {"slug": "tennessee-eviction-notice", "title": "Tennessee Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;displa